nh0.devnull.net is back online, finally.

It's glitch was a combination of bad memory (which accounted for the several
games lost silently) and administrative error (caused, as was pointed out by
several knowledgable folks here, by the fact that I didn't expect the showscore
option to change the save file format).

nh0 is joined by a new server at nh2.devnull.net; since each of them has _some_
of the saved games recovered from nh0, please check both is you had a game in
progress.  Please email the tournament admins if you had a game which didn't
make it through; even if you didn't have the game recorder on (which would at
least let us asign a lowball guess to your score) we can credit you with an
additional unique death.

Better news, of course, is that Matt's found the problem which was preventing
the tournament wrapper from backing up saved games on login and we've
propagated his fixed code to all the game servers, so we shouldn't see a
recurrence of a problem on this magnitude again.  ;-)

Our apologies,
-robin


